# CCS domain 2 (Coding Documentation) and domain 3 (Provider Queries).
# Each item: (stem, key, [3 wrong options], explanation). build.py puts the key in slot i % 4.
# Sources: FY2026 ICD-10-CM Official Guidelines (I.B.14, I.B.16, III), AHIMA/ACDIS Guidelines for
# Achieving a Compliant Query Practice (2022 update), CMS Conditions of Participation.

